From: u01jer@abdn.ac.uk (u01jer)

                              No More Mr. Nice Guy
                                  Alice Cooper

N.B. this is tabbed up from Megadeth's version (from a film soundtrack; Shocker
I believe), so there may be some discrepencies.  Where I've remembered what the
differences are, I've noted it.

Notation:

2/4     slide up
2h4     hammer on
4p2     pull off
2b4     Full bend
4r2     release bend
PM      Palm mute



